<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.7.3">
<l>atirmuka muṭaiya valampuri kumiḻtti yaḻalumi ḻāḻikoṇ ṭeṟintaṅ</l>
<l>ketirmuka vacurar talaikaḷai yiṭaṟu mempuru ṭōttama ṉirukkai</l>
<l>catumukaṉ kaiyil catuppuyaṉ tāḷil caṅkaraṉ caṭaiyiṉil taṅki</l>
<l>katirmuka maṇikoṇ ṭiḻipuṉal kaṅkaik kaṇṭameṉ ṉuṅkaṭi nakarē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The residence of our Puruṣottama,</l>
<l rend="indent">who, at one time, blew the conch with a thunderous mouth,</l>
<l>grabbed and threw [his] fire-spitting discus,</l>
<l rend="indent">[and] struck the heads of the demon [he] faced in battle,</l>
<l>is the protected city called Kaṇṭam [on the banks] of the Ganges</l>
<l rend="indent">[where] waters descend with brilliant jewels</l>
<l>from the hands of the four-faced [Brahmā],</l>
<l rend="indent">the feet of the four-armed [Viṣṇu]</l>
<l>[and] the matted locks of Śaṅkara.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
